        <mxCell id="note" value="Two distinct bodies. Synergify Institute for AI is the registered educational non-profit — legal operator, governance, payroll. S.A.S.H.A (Synergema Authentica Starseed Holon Academy) is the umbrella academy holding the spiritual-development catalog (astrology, shamanism, energy work, …). «Точка Сборки», produced &amp; managed by the Institute, is the gateway: completing it issues a golden admission ticket into S.A.S.H.A. No ownership link is required — the bridge is the credential." style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#f8fafc;strokeColor=#cbd5e1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=10;spacingTop=8;spacingRight=10;fontColor=#334155;fontSize=12;" vertex="1" parent="1">
